, beasts, elves, goblins, and the undead often fight side by side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏹 UNIQUE HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team, plan your tactics, combine skills, and adapt to every battle. The outcome depends entirely on choosing the right heroes. You can recruit the following into your squad:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even raise the dead <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/7f97dc5cbba34072189fa2e6c01ec962.poster.avif?t=1765143938\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/7f97dc5cbba34072189fa2e6c01ec962.webm?t=1765143938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/7f97dc5cbba34072189fa2e6c01ec962.mp4?t=1765143938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💥 FIGHT THE BEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a squad of 4–5 fighters, test your strategies in training, and then challenge other players in the arena. Each battle is a new test where not only strength matters, but also your ability to adapt to the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/4a312118ece2f5747460d2da2628bdc9.poster.avif?t=1765143938\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/4a312118ece2f5747460d2da2628bdc9.webm?t=1765143938\" type=\"vid